{'symbol': 'DHR', 'date': '2022-09-13 16:15:00', 'title': 'DANAHER ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'WASHINGTON , SEPT. 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DANAHER CORPORATION (NYSE: DHR) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS APPROVED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.25 PER SHARE OF ITS COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON OCTOBER 28, 2022 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD ON SEPTEMBER 30, 2022.'}